`cJSON_PrintBuffered` renders a cJSON tree to text with a preallocated buffer. Use it when you have a rough size estimate: larger `prebuffer` can reduce reallocations. `fmt=0` gives compact output, `fmt=1` pretty-prints. Returns `NULL` on negative `prebuffer`, alloc failure, or print failure.
