# Information about `cJSON_GetArraySize`

## Function Signature

```c
/* Returns the number of items in an array (or object). */
CJSON_PUBLIC(int)
cJSON_GetArraySize(const cJSON *array);
```

## Source Code

```c
CJSON_PUBLIC(int)
cJSON_GetArraySize(const cJSON *array) {
  cJSON *child = NULL;
  size_t size = 0;

  if (array == NULL) {
    return 0;
  }

  child = array->child;

  while (child != NULL) {
    size++;
