    ```
14. `cJSON_IsBool`
    `cJSON_IsBool` checks whether a `cJSON` item is a boolean (`true` or `false`). Use it to test an item before treating it as bool. Returns `false` for `NULL` and for non-bool types; otherwise `true` if `type` has `cJSON_True` or `cJSON_False`. Its signature is:
    ```c
    
