    ```
16. `cJSON_Duplicate`
    `cJSON_Duplicate` creates a copy of a `cJSON` item. Use it on an existing item pointer; `recurse=0` duplicates only the node, while `recurse!=0` also duplicates child items recursively. If `item` is `NULL`, it returns `NULL` via the internal helper. Its signature is:
    ```c
