    ```
18. `cJSON_ReplaceItemViaPointer`
    Replaces `item` in `parent` with `replacement` using pointers, preserving list links and shifting later items right. Use only when `item` belongs to `parent`. Returns `false` on NULL args; `true` if `replacement==item`; updates `parent->child` if replacing first item. Its signature is:
    ```c
