CJSON_PUBLIC(cJSON_bool) cJSON_ReplaceItemViaPointer(cJSON * const parent, cJSON * const item, cJSON * replacement);
    ```
19. `cJSON_SetNumberHelper`
    Helper for `cJSON_SetNumberValue`: sets a cJSON number’s `valuedouble` and clamps `valueint` to `INT_MIN/INT_MAX`. Use only on a valid `cJSON*`. If `object==NULL`, it returns `NAN` and does nothing. Its signature is:
    ```c
    /* helper for the cJSON_SetNumberValue macro */
CJSON_PUBLIC(double) cJSON_SetNumberHelper(cJSON *object, double number);
    ```


