    ```
15. `cJSON_CreateRaw`
    `cJSON_CreateRaw` creates a `cJSON_Raw` item holding a duplicated raw JSON text string. Use it when you want cJSON to store preformatted JSON without parsing it. If allocation or string dup fails, it deletes the item and returns `NULL`. Its signature is:
    ```c
