    `cJSON_IsFalse` checks whether a `cJSON` item is the JSON false literal. Use it on a `cJSON*` to test type. It returns `false` if `item == NULL`, otherwise `true` only when `(item->type & 0xFF) == cJSON_False`. Its signature is:
