​ ```
3. `cJSON_IsString`
​ `cJSON_IsString` checks whether a `cJSON` item is a string. Use it to test an item before reading `valuestring`. It returns `false` for `NULL`; otherwise `true` only when `(item->type & 0xFF) == cJSON_String`.
